  "emergency_instruction": "If this is a medical emergency, please go to the nearest hospital emergency room or call 911.",
  "setup_tips": {
    "step1": "Pick the type closest to your business. You can change everything later.",
    "step2": "We added services most clinics offer. Turn off what you don't do and add the prices you know. If you leave a price blank, your AI team will say the clinic will confirm it.",
    "step3": "Add each dentist and the days they're in the clinic. If someone takes a lunch break, tap 'Add second shift'.",
    "step4": "Your AI team never handles emergencies by itself. It shows this message right away and alerts you."
  },
  "_help": "A dental clinic pack. Hours default to two shifts a day (a lunch break between them). The HMO question is skipped when the clinic accepts no HMO cards, and the dentist question is skipped when there is only one dentist. Prices are never stored here: the owner adds them during setup."
